        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHAT IS THIS GAME?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You fight, you win, and you unlock stuff</strong>. Each playthrough is a session. If you die or quit, your character's progress resets, but your overall game progression is saved. You can also explore and find cool stuff too if you ever decide to take a break from combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW DOES COMBAT WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is simplistic but skill-based. It revolves around light attacks, heavy attacks, and dodges. So it's made to be <strong>minimalistic but juicy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.poster.avif?t=1788807098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.webm?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.mp4?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW DOES EXPLORATION WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely roam 3 different maps: <strong>the snowy peaks, the lakeside forest, and the forest fire aftermath</strong>, to discover stuff like <strong>echoes, totems, and landmarks to help with your progression. </strong>They also unlock trophies for you to view in the Trophy Selection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.poster.avif?t=1788807098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.webm?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.mp4?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW DOES UPGRADES WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades <i>(Mutations)</i> are given to you randomly when you level up. You can choose the upgrade that fits your playstyle. The game also has a bit of lore to help set the tone for each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.poster.avif?t=1788807098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.webm?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.mp4?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IS THIS THE GAME FOR YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinosaurs Dominion is designed for a compact experience. <strong>If you like dinosaurs</strong>, <strong>like to roam and discover stuff</strong>, and don't mind the game feeling a bit arcadey at times, then <strong>you might enjoy this game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 playable dinosaurs</strong>, each with a playstyle defined by size, power, and mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 mutations</strong> that let you evolve, specialize, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 open-world maps</strong>, each with unique biomes and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused simple <strong>one on one combat</strong> inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> with single-run challenges and permanent impact across journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landmarks</strong>, Relics, and Echoes that reward exploration with meaningful discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totems and Trophies</strong>, unlockable rewards that reveal deeper insights into the world.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHAT IS THIS GAME?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You fight, you win, and you unlock stuff</strong>. Each playthrough is a session. If you die or quit, your character's progress resets, but your overall game progression is saved. You can also explore and find cool stuff too if you ever decide to take a break from combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW DOES COMBAT WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is simplistic but skill-based. It revolves around light attacks, heavy attacks, and dodges. So it's made to be <strong>minimalistic but juicy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.poster.avif?t=1788807098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.webm?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.mp4?t=1788807098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW DOES EXPLORATION WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely roam 3 different maps: <strong>the snowy peaks, the lakeside forest, and the forest fire aftermath</strong>, to discover stuff like <strong>echoes, totems, and landmarks to help with your progression. </strong>They also unlock trophies for you to view in the Trophy Selection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati