FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 playable dinosaurs</strong>, each with a playstyle defined by size, power, and mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 mutations</strong> that let you evolve, specialize, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 open-world maps</strong>, each with unique biomes and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused simple <strong>one on one combat</strong> inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> with single-run challenges and permanent impact across journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landmarks</strong>, Relics, and Echoes that reward exploration with meaningful discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totems and Trophies</strong>, unlockable rewards that reveal deeper insights into the world.</p></li></ul>",
